    "title": "Mississippi Kidney opens Batesville clinic - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By none ,\n13 hours ago Mississippi Kidney opened its new Batesville clinic on Oct. 1, expanding the physician-owned kidney care practice’s presence in Mississippi as it adopts a new name.\nThe opening followed a ribbon-cutting and open house on Sept. 30. The practice, formerly known as Nephrology & Hypertension Associates, also has locations in Tupelo, Oxford and Clarksdale and has provided kidney care in Mississippi for nearly 50 years.\nThe practice will now operate under the name Mississippi Kidney.\nThe practice treats patients across a range of kidney-related conditions, including early kidney disease and hypertension, as well as advanced kidney disease. Its services also include dialysis care and transplant coordination.\nThe name change will include new clinic signage, updated materials and a new website . Patients will continue to see the same physicians and care teams, and no action is required from existing patients as a result of the change.\n5",
    "summary": "13 hours ago Mississippi Kidney opened its new Batesville clinic on Oct. 1, expanding the physician-owned kidney care practice’s presence in Mississippi as it adopts a new name. The practice, formerly known as Nephrology & Hypertension Associates, also has locations in Tupelo, Oxford and Clarksdale and has provided kidney care in Mississippi for nearly 50 years. The practice treats patients across a range of kidney-related conditions, including early kidney disease and hypertension, as well as advanced kidney disease. Its services also include dialysis care and transplant coordination.",
